                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d08a8112-9a5a-3d11-bab2-1efc507d3a2a",
                        "entry_id": "07aebeb9-439a-38b8-aea8-1768997f72dd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ce nom vernaculaire désigne plusieurs plantes annuelles ou vivaces de la famille des Poaceae (Poacées, ex graminées) mais appartenant à divers genres : Agrostis, Apera et Calamagrostis"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24117753-a7a0-465c-8ecd-b1effa62d9d8",
                                "sense_id": "d08a8112-9a5a-3d11-bab2-1efc507d3a2a",
                                "text": "Il vit défiler sur son passage des monticules, des broussailles qui frôlaient le ventre de son cheval, le chemin de terre où les ramules souples des tamaris lui cinglaient le front, des plaines illimitées foisonnantes d’agrostide et parsemées de vaches assoupies, de friches, de nouveaux monticules."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03d056ed-780e-4c54-b410-a4d50b4a0f94",
                        "source_entry_id": "07aebeb9-439a-38b8-aea8-1768997f72dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "d08a8112-9a5a-3d11-bab2-1efc507d3a2a",
                        "target_lang_word": "agrostis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agrostis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c24c17d0-808f-3c2b-92de-8efad5dc4d89",
                                        "entry_id": "cfd1c6b5-2eaa-3380-9eef-fa53575199d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any grass of the genus Agrostis of bentgrasses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "179e4c33-a5d6-41bb-814a-b28f50dcb2e5",
                                                "sense_id": "c24c17d0-808f-3c2b-92de-8efad5dc4d89",
                                                "text": "Above, see those delicate threads of the purple amoret, with its flood of anthers that are nearly yellow; the snowy pyramids of the meadow-sweet, the green tresses of the wild oats, the slender plumes of the agrostis, which we call wind-ear; roseate hopes, decking love's earliest dream and standing forth against the gray surroundings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4757ea1-3586-4c00-84ae-25f961d7c096",
                                                "sense_id": "c24c17d0-808f-3c2b-92de-8efad5dc4d89",
                                                "text": "The ground is littered with fallen trunks that lie crossed and recrossed like storm-lodged wheat; and besides this close forest of pines, the rich moraine soil supports a luxuriant growth of ribbon-leaved grasses--bromus, triticum, calamagrostis, agrostis, etc., which rear their handsome spikes and panicles above your waist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
